    "text": "Sum mann s\u00e6ig\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t synne nis nan \u00feing, & gyf \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0 is, \u00feonne is hit wunder, \u00fe\u00e6t God fordem\u00f0 \u00fea\nOf Gode synden ealle \u00feing, & ealle he geworhte heo gode, & for \u00fean we understande\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t synne nis nan\nHwa is wyrhte \u00fe\u00e6re synne?\nMann is wyrhte \u00feere synne, & deofol tyhtere.\nIs hit hefigteme \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6t man synegige?\nAn lytel synne, \u00feone man heo h\u00e6f\u00f0 gedon, beo his gewittscipe, heo is mare \u00feone eall middeneard, &\nHwu?\nNis manslege & forleger yfel?\nSume si\u00f0e by\u00f0 manslege god, swa hit w\u00e6s \u00fea \u00fea Dauid sloh Goliam, & Judith Holofernem.\nAc \u00feonne by\u00f0 mansl\u00e6ge yfel, \u00feonne man hine de\u00f0 beo his agene gewille unscellice, & forleger is on\nSy\u00f0\u00f0en God geworhte \u00fea gode & \u00fea yfele, & hit is gewriten \u00fe\u00e6t God ne hate\u00f0 nan \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feingen \u00fee he\nGod lufe\u00f0 ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee he geworhte, ac he ne gebring\u00f0 heo na ealla on anre wununga.\nSwa swa se litigere \u00fee lufe\u00f0 \u00e6lces heowes lit, ac naht ealla gelice, & \u00e6lc lit he f\u00e6stne\u00f0 on swylcen\nHw\u00e6t is agen cyre?\nHw\u00e6t is frigdom to geceosan god o\u00f0\u00f0e yfel?\n\u00deone frigdom h\u00e6fde mann on neorxenewange, ac nu is se fridom ge\u00f0eowtod, for se mann ne cann nan\nNe \u00feaget ne m\u00e6ig he hit gefor\u00f0igen, bute God him fylste \u00fe\u00e6rto.\nHw\u00e6t is beo \u00fean mannen \u00fee forwurpe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wurld, & gew\u00e6nde\u00f0 heora lif to drohtnunga for heora\nManega synden \u00fee beginne\u00f0 god to donne, & eft hit forl\u00e6te\u00f0, & gecerre\u00f0 to \u00fean yfele.\nOf swylce mannen is gewriten \u00fe\u00e6t heo gr\u00e6mige\u00f0 God.\nOn swylcen wisen \u00feegne\u00f0 se deofol ure Drihtene.\nHwu \u00feegne\u00f0 he him?\nFor he nolde beon mid uren Drihtene on wuldre mid wele & mid blisse buten geswynce, \u00fea geaf God\n\u00dea hameres & \u00fea beliges synden \u00fea costninga, \u00fea tangen synden ehteres, \u00fea fielen & \u00fea sagen synd\n\u00deurh swylcne smi\u00f0 & \u00feurh swylce tol, gecl\u00e6nsa\u00f0 ure Drihten \u00fe\u00e6re halgena sawlen, ac of \u00fean yfela\nHwy synden \u00fea ly\u00f0ere m\u00e6n swa welige on wurlde, & habbe\u00f0 of heore wille genoh, & \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t is for \u00fean gode mannen, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ascunigen & lytel tellen & unwur\u00f0 of \u00fean wele \u00fee \u00fea yfela\nHwy is eft \u00fe\u00e6t sum god mann h\u00e6f\u00f0 on wurlde genoge welen & \u00e6hte, & lichames h\u00e6le, & sum yfel\nFor \u00fean h\u00e6f\u00f0 ure Drihten gety\u00f0ed \u00fean gode mannen wele & \u00e6hte, \u00fe\u00e6t heo mugen on nytt beteon \u00fe\u00e6t\n& for \u00fean God gyf\u00f0 \u00fean gode mannen mihte, \u00fe\u00e6t heo gefor\u00f0igen \u00fe\u00e6t god \u00fe\u00e6t heo beginne\u00f0, \u00e6rest for\n& eft \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 sume yfele m\u00e6nn, \u00fee by\u00f0 swy\u00f0e byrstige & unfere, for \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t heo understanden beo\nHwu is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t manig yfel mann leofe\u00f0 lange, & manig god mann sone swelt, & eft sum god mann\nGod l\u00e6tt libben \u00fea yfele m\u00e6nn for \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea gode beon \u00feurh heom gefandode, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t heo heo\n& \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn swelte\u00f0 ra\u00f0e, for \u00fean \u00fee God nele \u00fe\u00e6t heo l\u00e6ng drohtnigen on \u00fean swicolan\n& eft sume \u00fea gode habbe\u00f0 lang lif, for \u00fean \u00fee heora earninga eh\u00f0 \u00e6lce d\u00e6ige mid godnyssen, & for\n& eft sume arlease m\u00e6nn sone swelte\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t heo sone habben \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00e6fter eodan, & eac for \u00fean\nSynden \u00fea m\u00e6nn ges\u00e6lige \u00fee nabbe\u00f0 on \u00feyssen wurlde nane erm\u00f0e?\nAc \u00fea syndon eremingas & unges\u00e6lige, \u00fee on eallra ednysse libbe\u00f0 heora lif, & habbe\u00f0 eall heora\nAc eadige by\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fea habbe\u00f0 on \u00feyssen wurlde mycelne wane & erm\u00f0e, & is mycel \u00e6fter of heore wille,\n\u00dea arlease m\u00e6nn \u00feeh heo habben on \u00feysser wurlde sum d\u00e6l heora gewilles, \u00feehhwe\u00f0ere heo by\u00f0\n& \u00fea gecorene \u00feeh heo habben \u00e6t sumen s\u00e6le earfo\u00f0nysse on \u00fean middenearde, \u00feehhwe\u00f0ere heo\nDo me \u00fe\u00e6t to understandene.\nYfele m\u00e6nn nabbe\u00f0 nane mihte, for \u00fean \u00fee God is heom gram, heo ne mugen willnigen nanes godes,\nHeo ne by\u00f0 n\u00e6fre teonlease, for heo by\u00f0 geteontrege\u00f0 mid hindre ge\u00f0anca, & heo by\u00f0 \u00e6fre on\n\u00dea habbe\u00f0 mycele mede for heo habbe\u00f0 blisse for \u00fe\u00e6re sicornysse Godes rice.\nGet ic \u00fee wylle an o\u00f0er seggen, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre ne sceal yfele mannen na god getidan, ne gode mannen nan\nHwy s\u00e6gst \u00feu swa?\nNe by\u00f0 yfele m\u00e6nn welige on middenearde, & f\u00e6gere, & spedige of \u00e6hte, & of f\u00e6gere gebytlen, & of\n& \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn by\u00f0 bereafode, & geswungene, & acwelmede on hungre & on cele.\n\u00d0eh hit \u00feynce mannen, \u00fe\u00e6t arlease m\u00e6nn habben wele on \u00feyssen wurlde, heo by\u00f0 \u00feehhw\u00f0ere swa swa\nEall swa \u00fea rice m\u00e6nn for \u00fean estlice meten & for \u00fea gode dr\u00e6ncen, heo sculen beon gefyllde mid\nAc \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn \u00fee habbe\u00f0 pine on \u00feyssen middenearde, for \u00fean cwarterne, & for \u00fea h\u00e6ftungan, heo",
